### Health check - auth
GET http://localhost:5001/health

###

### Health check - job
GET http://localhost:5002/health

###

### Register poster
POST {{authBaseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":"Test Poster","email":"poster@test.com","password":"password123","phone":"9876543210","role":"poster" }

###

### Register seeker
POST {{authBaseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":"Test Seeker","email":"seeker@test.com","password":"password123","phone":"9876500000","role":"seeker" }

###

### Login as poster (copy token into settings.json -> posterToken)
POST {{authBaseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"poster@test.com","password":"password123" }

###

### Login as seeker (copy token into settings.json -> seekerToken)
POST {{authBaseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"seeker@test.com","password":"password123" }

###

### Create job (poster) — internally calls auth-service for invoice check
# copy _id from response into settings.json -> jobId
POST {{jobBaseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobTitle":"Docker verification job",
  "description":"Testing cross-service call through Docker",
  "category":"plumbing",
  "jobType":"one-time",
  "workflowType":"daily_wage",
  "location":{"address":"Chennai","lat":13.08,"lng":80.27},
  "salary":{"amount":500,"type":"fixed"}
}

###

### Accept job (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

###

### Verify job — internally calls auth-service for candidate match info
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

###

### Approve job (poster)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

###

### Confirm (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

###

### Confirm (poster)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

###

### Finalize — calls auth-service to update reputation (the real test of the split)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}